66.5, 47.099998474121094], "pos": [2190.779052734375, 869.7244873046875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "pixels", "link": 56, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "像素"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 46, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "VAEEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEEncode"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [39], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [2178.665283203125, 359.2703552246094], "widgets_values": ["z_image_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "z_image_bf16.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_bf16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "widget_ue_connectable": {"weight_dtype": true, "unet_name": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [11], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [259.79998779296875, 401.8999938964844], "pos": [1892.4637451171875, 357.72540283203125], "widgets_values": ["好的，作为一名专业的AI图像生成提示词工程师，我将对这张图像进行深度解析，并为您创作出一个具有高度艺术性、氛围感和细节表现力的提示词。\n\n---\n\n### **图像深度解析**\n\n**1. 主体 (Subject):**\n图像的绝对主角是一位年轻女性，她是一位充满魅力的“西部女警”或“牛仔女战士”。她的形象融合了优雅、力量与神秘感。她戴着一顶装饰有复杂金色徽章的宽边牛仔帽，帽檐下是深邃的眼神和精致的五官，嘴唇涂着鲜艳的红色，与整体冷峻的色调形成强烈对比，极具视觉冲击力。她的长发呈深棕色，带有自然的波浪卷，部分发丝被夕阳染上金色，增添了一丝柔美。\n\n**2. 前景 (Foreground):**\n前景聚焦于这位女性的上半身和肩部，她正扛着一把巨大的、设计精美的“重型霰弹枪”或“机关枪”，枪身呈金属质感，表面有复杂的雕刻和铆钉，枪托部分有“CIMIN”字样，暗示其可能来自某个虚构或高端品牌。她的右臂微微抬起，似乎在调整武器或准备战斗，动作充满张力。她的腰间系着一条宽大的深紫色皮带，配有巨大的金色搭扣，皮带上还挂着一个装饰性的金色星形徽章，与帽子上的徽章相呼应，强化了“执法者”或“传奇战士”的身份。\n\n**3. 中景 (Midground):**\n中景是人物的服装细节。她穿着一件黑色的长款外套，内搭白色衬衫，领口敞开，露出锁骨和部分胸膛，增添了一丝性感与危险的气息。外套的前襟有三颗金色的菱形纽扣，设计感十足。下身是黑色与紫色相间的条纹短裤，搭配黑色透明长袜，腿部线条修长，展现出她作为“战士”的力量与优雅。她的左腿微微弯曲，右腿支撑身体，姿态充满动感。\n\n**4. 背景 (Background):**\n背景是一个模糊的、充满戏剧性的黄昏或黎明场景。天空呈现出柔和的粉橙色，云层被夕阳染成金色，远处隐约可见一座城市的轮廓，建筑的尖顶和轮廓线在雾气中若隐若现。这种背景不仅营造出一种“史诗感”和“宏大叙事”，还通过模糊处理将观众的注意力集中在主体人物身上。\n\n**5. 构图 (Composition):**\n构图采用了经典的“中心构图”与“对角线引导”相结合的方式。人物居于画面中央，但她的身体略微倾斜，形成一种动态平衡。她的武器从左肩斜向右下角延伸，形成一条有力的对角线，引导观众视线从她的面部到武器，再到背景。她的右手握着武器的握把，形成另一个视觉焦点，增强了画面的张力。\n\n**6. 视觉引导 (Visual Guidance):**\n视觉引导非常明确。观众的视线首先被她那双深邃的眼睛和鲜艳的红唇吸引，然后顺着她的身体轮廓和武器的线条，最终被引导到她腰间的金色徽章和武器的细节。背景的模糊处理进一步强化了这种引导，使画面更具层次感。\n\n**7. 光影氛围 (Lighting & Atmosphere):**\n光影处理极为出色。夕阳的光线从右上方照射下来，照亮了她的头发、脸颊、武器和服装的金属部分，形成强烈的高光和阴影对比。这种“逆光”效果不仅突出了她的轮廓，还营造出一种“英雄主义”或“史诗感”的氛围。整体色调偏冷，但通过暖色的夕阳和金色的装饰，形成冷暖对比，增强了画面的戏剧性。\n\n---\n\n### **AI图像生成提示词 (Prompt)**\n\n```\nA highly detailed, cinematic, and atmospheric portrait of a stunning young female Western law enforcement officer or cowboy warrior, standing confidently with a massive, ornate, and heavily detailed heavy shotgun or machine gun slung over her shoulder. She wears a wide-brimmed black cowboy hat adorned with intricate golden emblems, long dark brown wavy hair flowing down her shoulders, and a fierce, determined gaze with bright red lips. Her outfit consists of a sleek black long coat over a white shirt, with three golden diamond-shaped buttons on the front, paired with a dark purple and black striped shorts, black sheer stockings, and a wide, ornate purple belt with a large golden buckle. She has a star-shaped golden badge pinned to her coat. Her pose is dynamic, with one leg slightly bent and her right arm raised, gripping the weapon's handle. The background is a dramatic, blurred sunset or sunrise scene with soft pink and orange clouds, and distant city skyline silhouettes. The lighting is cinematic, with warm golden sunlight illuminating her hair, face, and weapon, creating strong highlights and deep shadows. The overall mood is epic, powerful, and mysterious, blending elegance with raw strength. Rendered in ultra-high-definition, with hyper-realistic textures, sharp details, and a sense of depth and atmosphere, as if captured by a professional-grade camera with a shallow depth of field, emphasizing the subject while blurring the background. Style: Digital illustration with a photorealistic touch, inspired by high-end game art and fantasy Western aesthetics.\n```\n\n---\n\n### **补充说明**\n\n这个提示词不仅涵盖了图像的视觉元素，还融入了情感、氛围和艺术风格的描述，使其在AI生成时能更精准地还原原图的精髓。通过“cinematic”、“epic”、“photorealistic”等词汇，可以引导AI生成更具艺术感和深度的作品。同时，加入“shallow depth of field”和“high-end game art”等关键词，可以增强画面的层次感和视觉冲击力。\n\n希望这个提示词能帮助您生成出令人惊艳的图像！"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 12, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [28], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [304.6619873046875, 88], "pos": [2526.274658203125, 594.9937744140625], "widgets_values": ["泛黄，发绿，模糊，低分辨率，低质量图像，扭曲的肢体，诡异的外观，丑陋，AI感，噪点，网格感，JPEG压缩条纹，异常的肢体，水印，乱码，意义不明的字符，泛蓝"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 41, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized